    "body": "> I vaguely recall promises not being a great building block for specifications, but I can't find the specific issue for this.\r\n\r\nI'm not following, particularly when you involve `AbortSignal`s... they are become very interdependent. Similarly, with [[=Promise/react=]](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-perform-steps-once-promise-is-settled).\r\n\r\nAnyway, can follow up in https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/issues/1672 ... \r\n",
