    "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:45:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-10T13:45:18Z",
    "body": "> I'm not following, particularly when you involve `AbortSignal`s... they are become very interdependent. Similarly, with [[=Promise/react=]](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-perform-steps-once-promise-is-settled).\r\n\r\nI don't follow how this is relevant to AbortSignals, can you elaborate?\r\n\r\nI wonder we can follow AbortSignal pattern where it defines abort algorithms, can we have \"fullscreen abort algorithms\" and allow other specs to add algorithms there? And run the algorithms when fullscreen is exited (and then drop them).",
